      "Text": "Security update for libcupsfilters",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for libcupsfilters fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-64611: infinite-loop CPU-exhaustion DoS in cfIEEE1284NormalizeMakeModel on empty MDL field (bsc#1273145).\n- CVE-2026-64612: malformed PNG aborts CUPS image filter process (bsc#1273146).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
